    "title": "Missing Schertz man found dead in wooded area, investigation ongoing - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago SCHERTZ, Texas — A 32-year-old man who was reported missing in Schertz has been found dead, police said Wednesday. The Schertz Police Department said John “Beau” Stein was reported missing on March 31. Authorities continued their investigation into April 1 and requested assistance from Texas Search and Rescue (TEXSAR), the Texas Department of Public Safety and the Selma Police Department. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
